1
00:00:00,934 --> 00:00:01,934
Goodbye.

2
00:00:02,001 --> 00:00:03,169
Be safe!

3
00:00:03,836 --> 00:00:06,840
I changed all of her schedule
to outer business.

4
00:00:07,374 --> 00:00:09,614
Hoping that a bit of distance
would affect their feelings

5
00:00:15,081 --> 00:00:16,583
It's so awkward,
it's killing me.

6
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:18,318
I didn't think about
this part.

7
00:00:19,352 --> 00:00:20,820
Not a lot of customers today

8
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:21,454
huh?

9
00:00:21,654 --> 00:00:22,654
Nope.

10
00:00:27,293 --> 00:00:28,695
Didn't you get enough sleep?

11
00:00:28,828 --> 00:00:29,828
No.

12
00:00:29,863 --> 00:00:32,399
- Why didn't you...
- May I be excused?

13
00:00:32,531 --> 00:00:33,531
Oh, okay.

14
00:00:36,936 --> 00:00:38,171
Gosh, it's so awkward.

15
00:00:38,438 --> 00:00:40,340
He seems fine when
he's with Hye-won.

16
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:41,380
Why is he like this to me?

17
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:46,346
Tomorrow, I'll be working
alone. It's been a while.

18
00:00:54,154 --> 00:00:55,688
This is Jude Flower.

19
00:00:55,955 --> 00:00:56,955
Pardon?

20
00:00:57,090 --> 00:00:59,259
Twenty flower bouquets
by tomorrow morning?

21
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:03,263
Normally, you need to
contact us two days before.

22
00:01:03,263 --> 00:01:05,665
[What if I pay you
twice the price?]

23
00:01:05,765 --> 00:01:06,966
I'll see you tomorrow!

24
00:01:08,401 --> 00:01:10,503
Tomorrow, I'll be
working alone...

25
00:01:12,839 --> 00:01:13,640
Eun-ho?

26
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:14,874
I'll be heading off first.

27
00:01:18,144 --> 00:01:20,413
Twenty bouquets...
all by me myself?
